flowchart TB
  TLWP[Wallet Provider Trusted List / LoTE]
  TLWP -->|public keys for Wallet Provider| PID2[PID or Attestation Provider]
  WP2[Wallet Provider] -->|signs WUA| WUA2["WUA: WSCA-WSCD claims, keys, certification…"]
  WUA2 -->|OpenID4VCI| PID2
  PID2 --> Vsig[Verify WUA signature]
  PID2 --> Vwsc[Assess WSCD claims / LoA if needed]
  PID2 --> Vbind[Nonce or proof keys live in that WSCD]
  CAB2[CAB / national wallet certification] -.->|underpins solution| WP2
